      "answer": "a. **Observational study.** The therapist observes existing records without assigning an exposure.\n\nb. **Observational study.** Exercise habits and weight are measured, but no treatment is assigned.\n\nc. **Controlled experiment.** Researchers assign the diet treatments and compare outcomes.\n\nd. **Double-blind experiment.** Treatment is assigned, and neither participants nor the administering nurse knows the assignment.",
